(6749559, 1010798, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this.  If it were mine, I''d alleviate all of the ones in the background and just have the animals on a white backdrop.  Clever folding!</td>', 'I like this.  If it were mine, I''d alleviate all of the ones in the background and just have the animals on a white backdrop.  Clever folding!', '2012-04-23 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749582, 1011075, 101256, '<td valign="top">Think this would have been a little - I don''t know humorous might be the word, if your model was smoking a cigarette and watching TV?  With Captain Kangaroo? :&gt;)<br/> <br/>I love it - great title too.</td>', 'Think this would have been a little - I don''t know humorous might be the word, if your model was smoking a cigarette and watching TV?  With Captain Kangaroo? :>) I love it - great title too.', '2012-04-23 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749586, 1011135, 101256, '<td valign="top">Now this is very good - I really like this.  The whole thing just comes together perfectly.  Well done.</td>', 'Now this is very good - I really like this.  The whole thing just comes together perfectly.  Well done.', '2012-04-23 10:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749587, 1011055, 101256, '<td valign="top">Took me a couple of seconds, but I finally figured it out. Nice job - interesting blend of techniques and color.  Well done - I''m in for a top ten on this one.</td>', 'Took me a couple of seconds, but I finally figured it out. Nice job - interesting blend of techniques and color.  Well done - I''m in for a top ten on this one.', '2012-04-23 10:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749590, 1011383, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is so phreakin'' phantastic I can''t spell properly. What an idea - just terrific.  Most excellent composition.  Well done - definitely a top five image and a strong contender for Best of Challenge.</td>', 'This is so phreakin'' phantastic I can''t spell properly. What an idea - just terrific.  Most excellent composition.  Well done - definitely a top five image and a strong contender for Best of Challenge.', '2012-04-23 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749591, 1011256, 101256, '<td valign="top">Certainly different - nicely composed and the clever use of the joker card with Batman was a stroke of genius. Top ten image for sure - top five probably.</td>', 'Certainly different - nicely composed and the clever use of the joker card with Batman was a stroke of genius. Top ten image for sure - top five probably.', '2012-04-23 10:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749605, 1011232, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and a very competent example of creative editing. I really like the lighting - subtle while at the same time, very edgy in terms of light bloom. Nice job - top ten I''m guessing.</td>', 'Clever and a very competent example of creative editing. I really like the lighting - subtle while at the same time, very edgy in terms of light bloom. Nice job - top ten I''m guessing.', '2012-04-23 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749607, 1011329, 101256, '<td valign="top">Like to know how many takes this one took to get it right. Great idea and good execution of that idea - very creative.  Well done.</td>', 'Like to know how many takes this one took to get it right. Great idea and good execution of that idea - very creative.  Well done.', '2012-04-23 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749608, 1011362, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is amazingly creative!</td>', 'This is amazingly creative!', '2012-04-23 10:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749612, 1011382, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not to be pedantic, but its Regius - regis is not a latin word. More properly, it should be Discordia Regina or Regius - depending on what you want to convey.<br/> <br/>Just sayin''.  :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Great image - must have taken a few tries to get it right like the previous image. Great idea and composition.  Well done.</td>', 'Not to be pedantic, but its Regius - regis is not a latin word. More properly, it should be Discordia Regina or Regius - depending on what you want to convey. Just sayin''.  :>) Great image - must have taken a few tries to get it right like the previous image. Great idea and composition.  Well done.', '2012-04-23 10:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749613, 1010798, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another clever and creative composition. There is some competition in this challenge that''s for sure. I like this as a top ten finisher. Well done.</td>', 'Another clever and creative composition. There is some competition in this challenge that''s for sure. I like this as a top ten finisher. Well done.', '2012-04-23 11:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749632, 1011378, 101256, '<td valign="top">I probably don''t know enough about Tarot to get the idea but I like the image.  Interesting use of lighting and the little touches are nifty - like the tea candles. Nothing to complain about - should get a good score.</td>', 'I probably don''t know enough about Tarot to get the idea but I like the image.  Interesting use of lighting and the little touches are nifty - like the tea candles. Nothing to complain about - should get a good score.', '2012-04-23 11:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749634, 1011362, 101256, '<td valign="top">I assume you are referring to Laevar Bolto - one of Superman''s super villains? If not, so what - cool image. Worth a ten just for the skill behind developing the image. Well done.</td>', 'I assume you are referring to Laevar Bolto - one of Superman''s super villains? If not, so what - cool image. Worth a ten just for the skill behind developing the image. Well done.', '2012-04-23 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749635, 1011384, 101256, '<td valign="top">Were the two spades and two clubs intentional? I like the image - plain, simple which is different. Nothing to really complain about from a technical standpoint.  Nice job.</td>', 'Were the two spades and two clubs intentional? I like the image - plain, simple which is different. Nothing to really complain about from a technical standpoint.  Nice job.', '2012-04-23 11:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749636, 1011164, 101256, '<td valign="top">Image looks washed out to me - no real definition to the subject matter - as I understand the subject to be. The jewelry looks sharp in one area and not to sharp in another. A little different angle in taking the image would have improved it - maybe a more top down look?</td>', 'Image looks washed out to me - no real definition to the subject matter - as I understand the subject to be. The jewelry looks sharp in one area and not to sharp in another. A little different angle in taking the image would have improved it - maybe a more top down look?', '2012-04-23 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749638, 1011414, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m probably being overly critical here, but the uneven lighting and the soft focus at the top of the card distracts from the intent - those trouble spots are where the eye is directed to (looking at the image as a whole). Another angle might have helped with a little more emphasis on even distance lighting and focus. Just my opinion you understand.</td>', 'I''m probably being overly critical here, but the uneven lighting and the soft focus at the top of the card distracts from the intent - those trouble spots are where the eye is directed to (looking at the image as a whole). Another angle might have helped with a little more emphasis on even distance lighting and focus. Just my opinion you understand.', '2012-04-23 11:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749639, 1011403, 101256, '<td valign="top">To be completely honest, I''m not at all sure what this is about or even what the point is. Image seems overly grainy with over driven color. That maybe the effect of the tiles, but the color spots are distracting and the cards don''t make any sense to me.</td>', 'To be completely honest, I''m not at all sure what this is about or even what the point is. Image seems overly grainy with over driven color. That maybe the effect of the tiles, but the color spots are distracting and the cards don''t make any sense to me.', '2012-04-23 11:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749644, 1011303, 101256, '<td valign="top">First of all, I''ll admit that my eye balls are old and I wear bifocals, but for the life of me I couldn''t get this image to properly focus in my minds eye. I couldn''t figure it out for a while, but it is the effect of over sharpened imagery on the white cards. If you look at the top of the white cards, you see a black outline - that usually is the result of over sharpening or going crazy with the unmask control. Also at the left corner of the Ace behind the Joker card is what looks like a burn mark - that is another sign of over sharpening. A little more lighting and less sharpening would have made this at least a 9 if not a 10.  I think an 8 is reasonable though because the composition is nifty and well thought out.</td>', 'First of all, I''ll admit that my eye balls are old and I wear bifocals, but for the life of me I couldn''t get this image to properly focus in my minds eye. I couldn''t figure it out for a while, but it is the effect of over sharpened imagery on the white cards. If you look at the top of the white cards, you see a black outline - that usually is the result of over sharpening or going crazy with the unmask control. Also at the left corner of the Ace behind the Joker card is what looks like a burn mark - that is another sign of over sharpening. A little more lighting and less sharpening would have made this at least a 9 if not a 10.  I think an 8 is reasonable though because the composition is nifty and well thought out.', '2012-04-23 12:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749647, 1011112, 101256, '<td valign="top">I know somebody who makes custom cards - it is a real art form depicted nicely here. The image looks a little washed out and the colors don''t have the "pop" you would normally expect for an image like this.  Its also a little large - a more condensed image might have made for a better composition. Still, a worthy image and nicely executed. Well done.</td>', 'I know somebody who makes custom cards - it is a real art form depicted nicely here. The image looks a little washed out and the colors don''t have the "pop" you would normally expect for an image like this.  Its also a little large - a more condensed image might have made for a better composition. Still, a worthy image and nicely executed. Well done.', '2012-04-23 12:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749650, 1011346, 101256, '<td valign="top">How many times have we done this by accident? Solid composition, good color and action - very nice capture.</td>', 'How many times have we done this by accident? Solid composition, good color and action - very nice capture.', '2012-04-23 12:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749652, 1011243, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition. Nicely composed and executed.  A little sharper focus would have made it better I think - lighter contrast, but it works as it is.</td>', 'Very clever composition. Nicely composed and executed.  A little sharper focus would have made it better I think - lighter contrast, but it works as it is.', '2012-04-23 12:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749697, 1011015, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and a nice job making it all work.  For some reason, the image looks a little greenish to me, but I just color corrected my monitor so it''s pretty accurate. Can''t complain about anything.</td>', 'Nice concept and a nice job making it all work.  For some reason, the image looks a little greenish to me, but I just color corrected my monitor so it''s pretty accurate. Can''t complain about anything.', '2012-04-23 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749699, 1011340, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t really say much about this. The cards, the sand - some thought went into this. Well done.</td>', 'Can''t really say much about this. The cards, the sand - some thought went into this. Well done.', '2012-04-23 12:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749700, 1011341, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good one - clever use of guitar and Ace of Spades - fifth or sixth album? Can''t remember.  Anyway, I like the concept - nice although I wonder how many will get it.  Side note: I bought a Squire Strat for my granddaughter and ended up modifying it with parts from a ''69 Strat basket case I had hanging around.  Came out nice and sounds like an early era Strat.</td>', 'Good one - clever use of guitar and Ace of Spades - fifth or sixth album? Can''t remember.  Anyway, I like the concept - nice although I wonder how many will get it.  Side note: I bought a Squire Strat for my granddaughter and ended up modifying it with parts from a ''69 Strat basket case I had hanging around.  Came out nice and sounds like an early era Strat.', '2012-04-23 12:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749701, 1011308, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just wondering here, but would this have worked better if the card was in color?  Maybe a little closer look rather than the soft focus?  Still, a worthy idea.</td>', 'Just wondering here, but would this have worked better if the card was in color?  Maybe a little closer look rather than the soft focus?  Still, a worthy idea.', '2012-04-23 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749703, 1011264, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect - great detail, excellent concept, right mood lighting - well done.  Should place in the top ten.</td>', 'Perfect - great detail, excellent concept, right mood lighting - well done.  Should place in the top ten.', '2012-04-23 12:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749714, 1011147, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good idea and it comes across well.  Well done.</td>', 'Good idea and it comes across well.  Well done.', '2012-04-23 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749715, 1011348, 101256, '<td valign="top">Heh - I love card tricks and this is a good representation.  Nice crisp focus, great balanced color, creative lighting - nice job.</td>', 'Heh - I love card tricks and this is a good representation.  Nice crisp focus, great balanced color, creative lighting - nice job.', '2012-04-23 13:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749721, 1011370, 101256, '<td valign="top">Obviously the photographer.  :&gt;)  Clever and truly inspired. Well done.</td>', 'Obviously the photographer.  :>)  Clever and truly inspired. Well done.', '2012-04-23 13:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749724, 1011247, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple, interesting background - I like it.</td>', 'Simple, interesting background - I like it.', '2012-04-23 13:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749727, 1011071, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a great story that Mark Twain told to an audience about this very circumstance.  Its hilarious - I''ll see if I can find it online. Anyway, I really like the over all look of this image - again, sharp focus, proper lighting sets the mood - very well done.  A top ten image hopefully.</td>', 'There is a great story that Mark Twain told to an audience about this very circumstance.  Its hilarious - I''ll see if I can find it online. Anyway, I really like the over all look of this image - again, sharp focus, proper lighting sets the mood - very well done.  A top ten image hopefully.', '2012-04-23 13:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749730, 1011374, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another clever composition. I like these simple concepts when they are properly executed - you don''t have to think a lot about where the author was going. I like the background - great focus control. Nice job - a top fifteen image for sure.</td>', 'Another clever composition. I like these simple concepts when they are properly executed - you don''t have to think a lot about where the author was going. I like the background - great focus control. Nice job - a top fifteen image for sure.', '2012-04-23 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749735, 1011065, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just to show you how picky the minds eye can be, my first reaction was why are there two different colors of nail polish?  :&gt;)  Which totally blew up my thoughts about this. I like the idea, but I''d would have preferred to see a little more total focus on the model. But that''s a nit pick. Well done.</td>', 'Just to show you how picky the minds eye can be, my first reaction was why are there two different colors of nail polish?  :>)  Which totally blew up my thoughts about this. I like the idea, but I''d would have preferred to see a little more total focus on the model. But that''s a nit pick. Well done.', '2012-04-23 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749736, 1011133, 101256, '<td valign="top">Highly detailed - amazing how detailed this image is. The concept is original too compared to some of the other entries. Nice job.</td>', 'Highly detailed - amazing how detailed this image is. The concept is original too compared to some of the other entries. Nice job.', '2012-04-23 13:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749737, 1011405, 101256, '<td valign="top">Define old. Yes, I know what Old Maid is and I''m 66 so what? Ageism? :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Great concept and composition. Sadly, most probably won''t get it.  Those that do - well yeah, we''re old.</td>', 'Define old. Yes, I know what Old Maid is and I''m 66 so what? Ageism? :>) Great concept and composition. Sadly, most probably won''t get it.  Those that do - well yeah, we''re old.', '2012-04-23 13:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749794, 1011133, 138253, '<td valign="top">Great texture here.</td>', 'Great texture here.', '2012-04-23 15:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749796, 1011374, 138253, '<td valign="top">Coours feel a little flat - would like to see more pop from the flowers.<br/>Good concept and execution though.</td>', 'Coours feel a little flat - would like to see more pop from the flowers.Good concept and execution though.', '2012-04-23 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749798, 1011341, 138253, '<td valign="top">I''d say "Lemmy would be proud", but I can''t since i don''t know him or if he would indeed be proud.<br/>I hope you''ll settle for "I''m proud to see a Motorhead reference and a consolation 6". :)<br/>I would''ve given higher if the DoF wasn''t as shallow - maybe bump up your focal length a stop or two to keep a little bit more of the guitar head in focus.</td>', 'I''d say "Lemmy would be proud", but I can''t since i don''t know him or if he would indeed be proud.I hope you''ll settle for "I''m proud to see a Motorhead reference and a consolation 6". :)I would''ve given higher if the DoF wasn''t as shallow - maybe bump up your focal length a stop or two to keep a little bit more of the guitar head in focus.', '2012-04-23 15:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749800, 1010942, 138253, '<td valign="top">Feeling overdone on the waterdrops lately, but this is a fresh take on it.<br/>I like that you''re reflecting the cards in back through the drop, but even in the reflection it''s OoF.<br/>6/10 for the shot - would''ve got a 9 if the drops were in full focus</td>', 'Feeling overdone on the waterdrops lately, but this is a fresh take on it.I like that you''re reflecting the cards in back through the drop, but even in the reflection it''s OoF.6/10 for the shot - would''ve got a 9 if the drops were in full focus', '2012-04-23 15:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749824, 1011370, 144365, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but it''s really bothering me that the cards you made don''t also have rounded corners.</td>', 'I love the idea, but it''s really bothering me that the cards you made don''t also have rounded corners.', '2012-04-23 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749828, 1011383, 144365, '<td valign="top">The eight cards around the clock have no rhyme or reason as far as I can tell.  Counted all the cards in the picture, and those are the eight that didn''t fit around the clock or on the face, but I don''t see the connection other than being the eight leftovers.</td>', 'The eight cards around the clock have no rhyme or reason as far as I can tell.  Counted all the cards in the picture, and those are the eight that didn''t fit around the clock or on the face, but I don''t see the connection other than being the eight leftovers.', '2012-04-23 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749829, 1011370, 41129, '<td valign="top">the joker is brilliant.. koolio</td>', 'the joker is brilliant.. koolio', '2012-04-23 16:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749832, 1011055, 41129, '<td valign="top">lol brilliant</td>', 'lol brilliant', '2012-04-23 16:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749833, 1011133, 41129, '<td valign="top">very well taken, love the textures.. great macro shot</td>', 'very well taken, love the textures.. great macro shot', '2012-04-23 16:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749837, 1011243, 144365, '<td valign="top">Giant growth for the win.<br/>Briar Shield, one of the most underrated cards no where.</td>', 'Giant growth for the win.Briar Shield, one of the most underrated cards no where.', '2012-04-23 16:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749852, 1011118, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on gambling and cards.  Probably happens more often than you''d think. Like the soft focus and sharp center - different.</td>', 'Interesting take on gambling and cards.  Probably happens more often than you''d think. Like the soft focus and sharp center - different.', '2012-04-23 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749853, 1011284, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on color and movement - I think a little faster shutter speed might have made this a better image.</td>', 'Interesting take on color and movement - I think a little faster shutter speed might have made this a better image.', '2012-04-23 17:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749854, 1011390, 101256, '<td valign="top">A end of game ritual in which the losers weep and the winners grin. Conceptually different from the rest of the entries. Just the right size - makes viewing easy. Nicely done.</td>', 'A end of game ritual in which the losers weep and the winners grin. Conceptually different from the rest of the entries. Just the right size - makes viewing easy. Nicely done.', '2012-04-23 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749855, 1010983, 101256, '<td valign="top">Seriously? Playing card pron? :&gt;)<br/> <br/>I''ve noticed this in a couple of other entries - the edges seem as if the image has been over sharpened or over use of the unsharp mask. It''s very noticeable with that slight halo around the edges. In this case it is very noticeable on the top card - I don''t think it is color bleed. What ever it is it distracts from the overall impact of the image.</td>', 'Seriously? Playing card pron? :>) I''ve noticed this in a couple of other entries - the edges seem as if the image has been over sharpened or over use of the unsharp mask. It''s very noticeable with that slight halo around the edges. In this case it is very noticeable on the top card - I don''t think it is color bleed. What ever it is it distracts from the overall impact of the image.', '2012-04-23 17:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749856, 1011389, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like these kind of imaginative takes on challenges. Pretty clever. One complaint is what I assume is the glue holing the cards in place.  The eye goes to that immediately and it distracts from the overall impact of the image.</td>', 'I like these kind of imaginative takes on challenges. Pretty clever. One complaint is what I assume is the glue holing the cards in place.  The eye goes to that immediately and it distracts from the overall impact of the image.', '2012-04-23 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749857, 1010947, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not afraid to admit that I don''t get it - I''m not the brightest bulb in the box, but I must be missing something.</td>', 'I''m not afraid to admit that I don''t get it - I''m not the brightest bulb in the box, but I must be missing something.', '2012-04-23 17:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749858, 1011369, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the fade, but I think it would have worked better with a better focus in the furthest cards - a little less fade would have worked better in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the fade, but I think it would have worked better with a better focus in the furthest cards - a little less fade would have worked better in my opinion.', '2012-04-23 17:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749859, 1011372, 101256, '<td valign="top">HA! Love it. Very clever and creative. Well done.</td>', 'HA! Love it. Very clever and creative. Well done.', '2012-04-23 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749860, 1011069, 101256, '<td valign="top">One earlier entry had a similar concept - both are very clever takes on flush suit of cards. Well done.</td>', 'One earlier entry had a similar concept - both are very clever takes on flush suit of cards. Well done.', '2012-04-23 17:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749864, 1011394, 101256, '<td valign="top">I found this to be highly amusing. There is no rhyme or reason for my amusement - it just tweaks the funny center of my brain.</td>', 'I found this to be highly amusing. There is no rhyme or reason for my amusement - it just tweaks the funny center of my brain.', '2012-04-23 17:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749866, 1010990, 101256, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of playing cards with my Granddaughter - she can''t keep a straight face if she had to. I think a little less length to the image would have made more impact  - the excitement is lost a little in the larger image.</td>', 'Reminds me of playing cards with my Granddaughter - she can''t keep a straight face if she had to. I think a little less length to the image would have made more impact  - the excitement is lost a little in the larger image.', '2012-04-23 17:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749867, 1011358, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have this thing about the junction of "art" and photography. There is a very fine line where the photograph becomes something different.  This doesn''t cross that line, but it is right on the edge and I like that. Well done.</td>', 'I have this thing about the junction of "art" and photography. There is a very fine line where the photograph becomes something different.  This doesn''t cross that line, but it is right on the edge and I like that. Well done.', '2012-04-23 17:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749869, 1010570, 101256, '<td valign="top">The antique look with the "film scratches" is a very nice touch. And there does not appear to be any green bleed over which is unusual with this much - what is there just adds to the overall impact of the image. Well done.</td>', 'The antique look with the "film scratches" is a very nice touch. And there does not appear to be any green bleed over which is unusual with this much - what is there just adds to the overall impact of the image. Well done.', '2012-04-23 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749870, 1011416, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t say much about this other than well done. By rights, this should place well within the top ten - if other reviewers get the point that is.</td>', 'Can''t say much about this other than well done. By rights, this should place well within the top ten - if other reviewers get the point that is.', '2012-04-23 17:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749881, 1011256, 16148, '<td valign="top">Clever entry!  You should score very well and hopefully make the top 3.</td>', 'Clever entry!  You should score very well and hopefully make the top 3.', '2012-04-23 18:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749900, 1011370, 16148, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll get a lot of comments from the active DPC members.  Very well done although your cards have square corners.  That''s a minor nitpick and doesn''t detract from your image.  Good luck!</td>', 'I think you''ll get a lot of comments from the active DPC members.  Very well done although your cards have square corners.  That''s a minor nitpick and doesn''t detract from your image.  Good luck!', '2012-04-23 18:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749901, 1011110, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot that works for me.</td>', 'Interesting shot that works for me.', '2012-04-23 18:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749950, 1011392, 101256, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many raters really looked at this before rating it. Personally, I think it is brilliant - the equal of some of the other highly rated images. I''ve been rating between 7 and 10 on this challenge because of the creativity that went into a lot of these images, but this one ranks right up there with what ever wins. Very creative and nicely lighted and composed.  By rights, this should be a top three image. Well done.</td>', 'I wonder how many raters really looked at this before rating it. Personally, I think it is brilliant - the equal of some of the other highly rated images. I''ve been rating between 7 and 10 on this challenge because of the creativity that went into a lot of these images, but this one ranks right up there with what ever wins. Very creative and nicely lighted and composed.  By rights, this should be a top three image. Well done.', '2012-04-23 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749951, 1011411, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and imaginative. A touch too much red bleed over on the Queen, but it works when looked at as a whole. Very imaginative. Nice job.</td>', 'Clever and imaginative. A touch too much red bleed over on the Queen, but it works when looked at as a whole. Very imaginative. Nice job.', '2012-04-23 19:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749953, 1011366, 101256, '<td valign="top">Black and white imagery is a favorite of mine and this is a very good example of what can be done with the genre. Nice.</td>', 'Black and white imagery is a favorite of mine and this is a very good example of what can be done with the genre. Nice.', '2012-04-23 19:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749955, 1011149, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another great black and white image. This one has some very subtle gray tone to it that just sets the entire scene. Nicely composed and executed. Well done.</td>', 'Another great black and white image. This one has some very subtle gray tone to it that just sets the entire scene. Nicely composed and executed. Well done.', '2012-04-23 19:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749956, 1011335, 101256, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it - seriously.</td>', 'I don''t get it - seriously.', '2012-04-23 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749959, 1011297, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think I know what the point is, but I''m not sure - this is a reference to Alice in Wonderland right? In any case, I think this could have done with a little more thought and definitely color - it just doesn''t work for me in black and white. But that is my opinion - nothing to be taken seriously. :&gt;)</td>', 'I think I know what the point is, but I''m not sure - this is a reference to Alice in Wonderland right? In any case, I think this could have done with a little more thought and definitely color - it just doesn''t work for me in black and white. But that is my opinion - nothing to be taken seriously. :>)', '2012-04-23 19:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749960, 1010548, 101256, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t know what to say.  I know it has something to do with losing obviously, but what is the subject that the image is supposed to portray? I''m not trying to be mean, but to me, this doesn''t represent anything like the title - I don''t mean to be harsh, but why this?</td>', 'I honestly don''t know what to say.  I know it has something to do with losing obviously, but what is the subject that the image is supposed to portray? I''m not trying to be mean, but to me, this doesn''t represent anything like the title - I don''t mean to be harsh, but why this?', '2012-04-23 19:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749961, 1011325, 101256, '<td valign="top">I must be missing something with this extreme blur images - another that I don''t get. Admittedly, I''m not up to total speed on popular culture, but this doesn''t make any sense to me  other than a vague image of a Joker card. What ever the concept was it doesn''t make any sense to me - I''m sorry.</td>', 'I must be missing something with this extreme blur images - another that I don''t get. Admittedly, I''m not up to total speed on popular culture, but this doesn''t make any sense to me  other than a vague image of a Joker card. What ever the concept was it doesn''t make any sense to me - I''m sorry.', '2012-04-23 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749962, 1011029, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming that this is a reference to a Batman movie - none of which I have seen. :&gt;)  I''ll just take it as a Batman thing - even though I''m not familiar with the mythology. :&gt;)</td>', 'I''m assuming that this is a reference to a Batman movie - none of which I have seen. :>)  I''ll just take it as a Batman thing - even though I''m not familiar with the mythology. :>)', '2012-04-23 19:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749963, 1011385, 101256, '<td valign="top">Took me a while, but I finally figured it out - after about four viewings. I''ll admit it - I''m slow on the uptake sometimes. Call it advancing age. Good conceptual imagery. I think it could have used a little faster shutter speed, but that is a personal opinion and nothing that I should rate on.</td>', 'Took me a while, but I finally figured it out - after about four viewings. I''ll admit it - I''m slow on the uptake sometimes. Call it advancing age. Good conceptual imagery. I think it could have used a little faster shutter speed, but that is a personal opinion and nothing that I should rate on.', '2012-04-23 20:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749964, 1011110, 101256, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite "reality" shows. A good conceptual look at targets and card scaling - or the art of throwing cards. I like it - well done.</td>', 'One of my favorite "reality" shows. A good conceptual look at targets and card scaling - or the art of throwing cards. I like it - well done.', '2012-04-23 20:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749965, 1011300, 101256, '<td valign="top">I can''t think of anything to say that would make any sense about this. I think I know what the author was looking for, I''m just not sure that it comes across as intended. In any case, from a technical standpoint, there isn''t much to complain about.</td>', 'I can''t think of anything to say that would make any sense about this. I think I know what the author was looking for, I''m just not sure that it comes across as intended. In any case, from a technical standpoint, there isn''t much to complain about.', '2012-04-23 20:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749966, 1010942, 101256, '<td valign="top">I looked at this four or five times trying to get a handle on what the image was about as the title sure as hell didn''t give a hint.  :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Then I noticed the drops.  Now that is really subtle - clever, but WAY too subtle. I think this technique could be used in any of the challenges so it may be something the author might want to try.</td>', 'I looked at this four or five times trying to get a handle on what the image was about as the title sure as hell didn''t give a hint.  :>) Then I noticed the drops.  Now that is really subtle - clever, but WAY too subtle. I think this technique could be used in any of the challenges so it may be something the author might want to try.', '2012-04-23 20:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749967, 1011375, 101256, '<td valign="top">The technique is called "scaling" and it''s a favorite staple of The Joker. In theory, using a card can be an effective "weapon" as the world speed record for a scaled card is 95 mph. Just thought you''d like to know. Just as a thought, instead of the Ace of Hearts, might have been fun to use the Joker. Get it? <br/> <br/>Great image and one demonstrating something not normally thought of. Love the grain and imagery in general. Top fifteen if not a top ten.</td>', 'The technique is called "scaling" and it''s a favorite staple of The Joker. In theory, using a card can be an effective "weapon" as the world speed record for a scaled card is 95 mph. Just thought you''d like to know. Just as a thought, instead of the Ace of Hearts, might have been fun to use the Joker. Get it?  Great image and one demonstrating something not normally thought of. Love the grain and imagery in general. Top fifteen if not a top ten.', '2012-04-23 20:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749969, 1011096, 101256, '<td valign="top">I held off on this image until I had done the rest because - well yeah, it''s falling cards being scattered about. That''s about it I guess.  Nothing to complain about either. It''s just a photo of falling cards - no background, no anything other than cards.</td>', 'I held off on this image until I had done the rest because - well yeah, it''s falling cards being scattered about. That''s about it I guess.  Nothing to complain about either. It''s just a photo of falling cards - no background, no anything other than cards.', '2012-04-23 20:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6749974, 1011352, 101256, '<td valign="top">From an artistic standpoint, this works fine. It could also have worked with a higher shutter speed and a little more definition in the card shuffle. In either case, it is a nice image and composition. Nice job.</td>', 'From an artistic standpoint, this works fine. It could also have worked with a higher shutter speed and a little more definition in the card shuffle. In either case, it is a nice image and composition. Nice job.', '2012-04-23 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
