(6751505, 1011375, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if we would see something like this. Nicely done.</td>', 'I was wondering if we would see something like this. Nicely done.', '2012-04-25 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751506, 1010570, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool collection of cards.</td>', 'What a cool collection of cards.', '2012-04-25 12:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751507, 1011112, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea. Very much like how you added the painting action to this.<br/> <br/>Did you finish the deck? That would be a fun project to show off.</td>', 'What a cool idea. Very much like how you added the painting action to this. Did you finish the deck? That would be a fun project to show off.', '2012-04-25 12:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751509, 1011374, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!</td>', 'Cute idea!', '2012-04-25 12:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751510, 1011149, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great choice in lighting.</td>', 'Great choice in lighting.', '2012-04-25 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752154, 1011308, 37629, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic, Though technically not a perfect photo the blurriness and overexposed whites really work here. I dig the desaturated sepia tone, kind of creepy, the slightly off centred subject also somehow works, well done! 8</td>', 'This is fantastic, Though technically not a perfect photo the blurriness and overexposed whites really work here. I dig the desaturated sepia tone, kind of creepy, the slightly off centred subject also somehow works, well done! 8', '2012-04-26 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752155, 1011372, 37629, '<td valign="top">Oh ho hooooo hahah.</td>', 'Oh ho hooooo hahah.', '2012-04-26 01:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752156, 1011071, 37629, '<td valign="top">the smokiness of the bloom effect sorrrrt of works. I enjoy this image.</td>', 'the smokiness of the bloom effect sorrrrt of works. I enjoy this image.', '2012-04-26 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752158, 1011135, 37629, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, the execution isn''t too bad, the composition being slightly off centre bugs me here. Something about the shot doesn''t work, maybe if you just cut holes in the queens instead of the slow shutter situation, I''m trying to put my finger on it and I think it''s the bizarre overlap of it.</td>', 'interesting shot, the execution isn''t too bad, the composition being slightly off centre bugs me here. Something about the shot doesn''t work, maybe if you just cut holes in the queens instead of the slow shutter situation, I''m trying to put my finger on it and I think it''s the bizarre overlap of it.', '2012-04-26 01:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752159, 1011096, 37629, '<td valign="top">one of the better 52 pickup shots.</td>', 'one of the better 52 pickup shots.', '2012-04-26 01:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752160, 1011370, 37629, '<td valign="top">Oh man, you should''ve totally rounded the edges on the DPC cards. Hilarious and well done though.</td>', 'Oh man, you should''ve totally rounded the edges on the DPC cards. Hilarious and well done though.', '2012-04-26 01:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752161, 1011133, 37629, '<td valign="top">it took me a moment to see it, but very clever and nice shot. good luck.</td>', 'it took me a moment to see it, but very clever and nice shot. good luck.', '2012-04-26 01:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752162, 1011403, 37629, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the effort put forth, very nice drawings for a scale so tiny. It would''ve been easier to print off some tiny cards. In post process i would''ve adjusted the saturation a little bit. I get the idea but its not a very successful one, I feel like you went with the first thing that came to mind and stuck to it, a different card/discoball situation may have been more successful.</td>', 'I enjoy the effort put forth, very nice drawings for a scale so tiny. It would''ve been easier to print off some tiny cards. In post process i would''ve adjusted the saturation a little bit. I get the idea but its not a very successful one, I feel like you went with the first thing that came to mind and stuck to it, a different card/discoball situation may have been more successful.', '2012-04-26 01:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752163, 1011110, 37629, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2012-04-26 01:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752164, 1011335, 37629, '<td valign="top">lol what?</td>', 'lol what?', '2012-04-26 01:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752165, 1011358, 37629, '<td valign="top">a beautiful and fantastic photo. Those cards look awesome btw. well done. One of my favourites in the challenge.</td>', 'a beautiful and fantastic photo. Those cards look awesome btw. well done. One of my favourites in the challenge.', '2012-04-26 01:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752166, 1011378, 37629, '<td valign="top">the lighting is really off here, i think a bounce coming in from the left hand side might''ve helped, it''s tricky with the little lamp though. It might''ve been better if her legs were crossed and she was just on the floor, the tidiness of the candles is a little off putting as well, things like that and the minimal amount of props give the photo that super staged feel which can be ok sometimes but I don''t think it works here. Everything above the table works really well and I enjoy it a lot. Not a bad shot!</td>', 'the lighting is really off here, i think a bounce coming in from the left hand side might''ve helped, it''s tricky with the little lamp though. It might''ve been better if her legs were crossed and she was just on the floor, the tidiness of the candles is a little off putting as well, things like that and the minimal amount of props give the photo that super staged feel which can be ok sometimes but I don''t think it works here. Everything above the table works really well and I enjoy it a lot. Not a bad shot!', '2012-04-26 01:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752167, 1011362, 37629, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of katamari damacy''s king of the cosmos, nice.</td>', 'this reminds me of katamari damacy''s king of the cosmos, nice.', '2012-04-26 01:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
