(6752412, 1010798, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly creative, and I love the way the animals have turned out.  Focus is crisp, and lighting on the foreground is good.  Not so keen on the composition of the cards at the back, and wish the patch top left was covered as it contrasts quite markedly with the stark whiteness of the foreground.</td>', 'Certainly creative, and I love the way the animals have turned out.  Focus is crisp, and lighting on the foreground is good.  Not so keen on the composition of the cards at the back, and wish the patch top left was covered as it contrasts quite markedly with the stark whiteness of the foreground.', '2012-04-26 13:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6752416, 1010983, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good crisp focus - and even good textural detail!</td>', 'Good crisp focus - and even good textural detail!', '2012-04-26 13:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
