(6753170, 1011015, 49954, '<td valign="top">I stand corrected.  They were originally playing cards in Europe before being corrupted for their mystic uses.  The said, it''s an obscure historical note that most won''t be aware of -- especially in light of the fact of the theme of your photo is toward their mystical use and not a game.<br/> <br/>That said, it did meet the challenge.  So judging solely on theme and content and presentation -- I would rate this a 5, then knock it down 1 because of the subject matter... so I am changing this from a 1 to a 4 (had it remained DNMC I normally apply a -3 penalty, that''s how the 4 would have been a 1).</td>', 'I stand corrected.  They were originally playing cards in Europe before being corrupted for their mystic uses.  The said, it''s an obscure historical note that most won''t be aware of -- especially in light of the fact of the theme of your photo is toward their mystical use and not a game. That said, it did meet the challenge.  So judging solely on theme and content and presentation -- I would rate this a 5, then knock it down 1 because of the subject matter... so I am changing this from a 1 to a 4 (had it remained DNMC I normally apply a -3 penalty, that''s how the 4 would have been a 1).', '2012-04-27 11:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
