(6755210, 1011370, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very creative and humorous Wendy. VWD. I think one challenge, in over 1500 challenges, a bit of community fun is allowed. I mean Ken is doing it all the time :) How many newbies are now seeing who all the <strike>characters</strike> suspects are... +1</td>', 'Very creative and humorous Wendy. VWD. I think one challenge, in over 1500 challenges, a bit of community fun is allowed. I mean Ken is doing it all the time :) How many newbies are now seeing who all the characters suspects are... +1', '2012-04-30 05:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6755217, 1011370, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> $1500-00 a set????  Whoa....you are the rip-off queen, when you can purchase a custom set for less than $5-00 a set....lmao!!!  Although as I said before the challenge started....it would be a great idea to the set available to DPCérs!  Congrats on ribboning. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m positive that that was a joke... sarcasm... just for fun... a lark.   :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL...yeah I know...hence the ''lmao'' in the comment!!</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Originally posted by Judi: $1500-00 a set????  Whoa....you are the rip-off queen, when you can purchase a custom set for less than $5-00 a set....lmao!!!  Although as I said before the challenge started....it would be a great idea to the set available to DPCérs!  Congrats on ribboning.   I''m positive that that was a joke... sarcasm... just for fun... a lark.   :D   LOL...yeah I know...hence the ''lmao'' in the comment!!', '2012-04-30 06:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
