(6755238, 1011370, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> $1500-00 a set????  Whoa....you are the rip-off queen, when you can purchase a custom set for less than $5-00 a set....lmao!!!  Although as I said before the challenge started....it would be a great idea to the set available to DPCérs!  Congrats on ribboning. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey!! It''s not my fault! You, Bear, Whiterook and Art were very reasonable in your model negotiations.<br/> <br/>However, Grog''s bevy of lawyers demanded $1498.47 per deck, and I had already finished the shoot. What was I supposed to do??<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-30 06:24:25.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: $1500-00 a set????  Whoa....you are the rip-off queen, when you can purchase a custom set for less than $5-00 a set....lmao!!!  Although as I said before the challenge started....it would be a great idea to the set available to DPCérs!  Congrats on ribboning.   Hey!! It''s not my fault! You, Bear, Whiterook and Art were very reasonable in your model negotiations. However, Grog''s bevy of lawyers demanded $1498.47 per deck, and I had already finished the shoot. What was I supposed to do??', '2012-04-30 07:24:11.000000', '2012-04-30 07:24:25.000000', 0),
