(6756987, 1011112, 114682, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your nice comments, votes and support. I can only imagine that I was disqualified because of using clone stamp tool to clone out parts of the cards that are now white (two decks to the left and two hearts from the actual card that is being painted). Quite disappointing, as that was the whole point, the whole creative idea. I didn''t have any clue that that would be judged as illegal.</td>', 'Thank you for your nice comments, votes and support. I can only imagine that I was disqualified because of using clone stamp tool to clone out parts of the cards that are now white (two decks to the left and two hearts from the actual card that is being painted). Quite disappointing, as that was the whole point, the whole creative idea. I didn''t have any clue that that would be judged as illegal.', '2012-05-01 20:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
